{%- comment -%}
  STORE CREDIT BAR (26 Nov 2026). A signed-in customer with a store credit balance sees one quiet line at the very
  top of every theme page: "Your Marathon balance: R350 — ready to spend". Rendered from layout/theme.liquid, above
  the announcement bar and header, so it is on every page the theme draws.

  Renders NOTHING unless all three hold:
    - a customer is signed in (`customer` is nil for guests),
    - they have a store credit account in the currency they are browsing in
      (`customer.store_credit_account` is nil otherwise, per the Liquid docs),
    - its balance is above zero.

  `balance` is a money object in the shopper's presentment currency, so the money filter formats it like every other
  price on the site. The whole line links to the account page. The shop uses NEW customer accounts, so /account
  redirects to Shopify's hosted account (shopify.com/73571270805/account), which shows the store credit balance on its
  own — that page is not part of the theme and cannot carry this bar.

  Store credit is spent at checkout under Payment as "Apply store credit", and only when the customer is signed in
  there — the reason the line points at the account.

  Customer copy rule: no emojis, no staff names.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if customer and customer.store_credit_account and customer.store_credit_account.balance > 0 -%}
  {%- assign mc_credit = customer.store_credit_account.balance | money_without_trailing_zeros -%}
  <aside class="mc-credit-bar" aria-label="Store credit">
    <a class="mc-credit-bar__link" href="{{ routes.account_url }}">
      <span class="mc-credit-bar__label">Your Marathon balance:</span>
      <span class="mc-credit-bar__amount">{{ mc_credit }}</span>
      <span class="mc-credit-bar__note"><span aria-hidden="true">&mdash;</span> ready to spend</span>
    </a>
  </aside>
  <style>
    .mc-credit-bar {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 3;
      background: rgb(13 12 11);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.08);
      font-family: var(--font-body-family);
      font-style: normal;
    }
    .mc-credit-bar__link {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0 0.6rem;
      max-width: var(--page-width, 120rem);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0.9rem 1.6rem;
      color: rgb(247 248 250 / 0.75);
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
      letter-spacing: 0.02rem;
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .mc-credit-bar__link, .mc-credit-bar__link span { font-style: normal; }
    .mc-credit-bar__amount {
      color: rgb(247 248 250);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      letter-spacing: 0.03rem;
    }
    .mc-credit-bar__link:hover .mc-credit-bar__note,
    .mc-credit-bar__link:focus-visible .mc-credit-bar__note {
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 0.3rem;
    }
    .mc-credit-bar__link:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid rgb(247 248 250 / 0.6);
      outline-offset: -4px;
    }
    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      .mc-credit-bar__link { padding: 1rem 5rem; font-size: 1.35rem; }
    }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
